# Infra stacks (all teams). Copy to infra/.env — never commit.
# Optional override per env: infra/<team>/config/<env>/.env (loaded after this file).
#
# Local: TF_VAR_* below.
# Terraform Cloud: use workspace or environment-scoped variables with TF_VAR_*
# (e.g. prod workspace variable set) — same names, no .env in git.
#
# Example (commented):
# TF_VAR_example=
